        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Mosca-Abelha. Ao perceber a aura de pessoas ou Pokémon se divertindo, Cutiefly se aproxima e dá uma picada dolorosa com sua longa tromba. Ele também a usa para sugar pólen e néctar, guardando na pelagem o que não consegue comer.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Inseto, Fada &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Cutiefly pode evoluir para Ribombee no nível 9 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Absorb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Fairy Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Stun Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Struggle Bug</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Silver Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Draining Kiss</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Sweet Scent</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Bug Buzz</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Covet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Dazzling Gleam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Aromatherapy, Switcheroo</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Quiver Dance</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, After You, Ally Switch, Attract, Baton Pass, Bug Bite, Bug Buzz, Calm Mind, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Defog, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Dream Eater, Dual Wingbeat, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fake Tears, Frustration, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Imprison, Infestation, Last Resort, Leech Life, Light Screen, Magic Room, Magical Leaf, Play Rough, Pollen Puff, Pounce, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Reflect, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Safeguard, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Speed Swap, Struggle Bug, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, Trick, U-turn, Wonder Room</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aromatic Mist, Baton Pass, Bestow, Moonblast, Powder, Skill Swap, Speed Swap, Sticky Web</p>",
